# Acceptance Testing — DonateNow v2.0

> Version: 2.0 — Multi-Cause Donation Platform
> Reference: [KPI.mdc](../Context/KPI.mdc) | [Test_Cases.mdc](./Test_Cases.mdc) | [PRD.mdc](../Context/PRD.mdc)

---

## 1. Acceptance Testing Strategy

### Purpose
Acceptance testing verifies that v2.0 meets all business requirements and is ready for release. It validates user flows, edge cases, and non-functional requirements from the end-user perspective.

### Types of Acceptance Testing

| Type | Purpose | Who Executes |
|---|---|---|
| **Functional Acceptance** | Each feature works as specified in PRD | QA / Developer |
| **User Acceptance (UAT)** | Real user validates flows are intuitive | Product Owner / Stakeholders |
| **Operational Acceptance** | System meets performance, security standards | DevOps / Developer |
| **Migration Acceptance** | v1.0 data migrated correctly | Database Admin |

